{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48201","headline":"嘲萧瑀射 · 欧阳询","name":"嘲萧瑀射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"急风吹缓箭，弱手驭强弓。\n欲高飜复下，应西还更东。\n十回俱着地，两手幷擎空。\n借问谁爲此，乃应是宋公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳询","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}